Cell["\<\
coefficients is the association returned by PauliGellMannDecomposition. \
dimensions specifies the same ordered tensor factors, each equal to 2 or 3.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1226738154,ExpressionUUID->"9add670c-22e9-8d47-bc6c-5cc3741e2128"],

Cell["\<\
The result uses string heads \"\[Sigma]\" and \"\[Lambda]\" for Pauli and \
Gell-Mann factors, and CircleTimes for tensor products. It is a symbolic \
representation rather than a matrix.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->583507458,ExpressionUUID->"08f45b71-ec1a-094e-82c6-4b5221de36d8"]
}, Closed]],

